ass="form-text">Option price becomes an optional surcharge when selected.</div></div><?php if($hasUnitCost): ?><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="unit_cost">Unit cost (₱, optional)</label><input class="form-control" name="unit_cost" id="unit_cost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="<?=e((string)$entry['unit_cost'])?>"><div class="form-text">Used in gross margin reporting. Leave blank if not tracked.</div></div><?php endif; ?><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="publish_at">Release time (Asia/Manila)</label><input class="form-control" name="publish_at" id="publish_at" type="datetime-local" value="<?=e($entry['publish_at'])?>"><div class="form-text">Leave blank for immediate release after an admin activates the entry.</div></div></div>
